('63', 'articles of Chapter 96 (for example, brushes, travel sets for sewing, slide fasteners, typewriter ribbons, sanitary towels (pads) and tampons, napkins (diapers) and napkin liners)', ARRAY['96']::text[], NULL, 'Section XI Note 1(u)', 'This section does not cover: a. animal brush-making bristles or hair (heading 0502); horsehair or horsehair waste (heading 0511); b. human hair or articles of human hair (heading 0501, 6703 or 6704), except filtering or straining cloth of a kind commonly used in oil-presses or the like (heading 5911); c. cotton linters or other vegetable materials of Chapter 14; d. asbestos of heading 2524 or articles of asbestos or other products of heading 6812 or 6813; e. articles of heading 3005 or 3006; ...'),
('63', 'articles of Chapter 97', ARRAY['97']::text[], NULL, 'Section XI Note 1(v)', 'This section does not cover: a. animal brush-making bristles or hair (heading 0502); horsehair or horsehair waste (heading 0511); b. human hair or articles of human hair (heading 0501, 6703 or 6704), except filtering or straining cloth of a kind commonly used in oil-presses or the like (heading 5911); c. cotton linters or other vegetable materials of Chapter 14; d. asbestos of heading 2524 or articles of asbestos or other products of heading 6812 or 6813; e. articles of heading 3005 or 3006; ...'),
